1
00:00:00,483 --> 00:00:01,813
[SCANNER BEEPS]

2
00:00:02,318 --> 00:00:07,738
(Sheldon:)Socks, one pair, cotton, argyle, blue.

3
00:00:11,911 --> 00:00:13,791
(Sheldon:)What on earth are you doing?

4
00:00:14,497 --> 00:00:17,337
(Raj:)Whatever it is,
I'm guessing we're doing it wrong.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,250
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen, this is the Coast Starlight...

6
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:26,170
(Sheldon:)...one of the great American trains operating
on one of the classic American routes.

7
00:00:26,342 --> 00:00:29,182
(Sheldon:)On this side,
you'll see panoramic ocean vistas...

8
00:00:29,345 --> 00:00:32,135
(Sheldon:)...inaccessible
to any other form of transportation.

9
00:00:32,306 --> 00:00:35,596
(Sheldon:)While on your side
you'll be treated to 350 miles...

10
00:00:35,768 --> 00:00:39,518
...of Costcos, Jiffy Lubes and cinder block
homes with above-ground pools.

11
00:00:41,941 --> 00:00:44,281
- Come on, Raj.
- What's wrong with Jiffy Lubes?

12
00:00:46,028 --> 00:00:47,448
(Sheldon:)No.

13
00:00:48,531 --> 00:00:50,701
- Why not?
- That's over the wheelbase.

14
00:00:50,866 --> 00:00:54,036
(Sheldon:)Are you completely unfamiliar
with the suspension characteristics...

15
00:00:54,203 --> 00:00:58,083
(Sheldon:)...of a pre-1980 Pullman-built
Superliner Deluxe passenger coach?

